# Runtime-generated, machine-owned (design.md §9.5): never commit.
# Anchored (`/`-prefixed) to the specific runtime locations -- both the
# top-level host-direct-run dirs AND the REQ2-relocated docker/{inbox,
# state,output}/ dirs -- so an UNANCHORED pattern (which would also
# match report-export/docker/example/{state,input}/, the REQ4
# committed demo fixtures) never accidentally blocks committing them.
/state/
/output/
/inbox/
/docker/state/
/docker/output/
/docker/inbox/

# Python / tooling
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/

# Dev-tool caches (supplements the required list above; same rationale --
# machine-generated, never meant to be committed).
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
